      "Q": {
        "slot": "Q",
        "id": "YunaraQ",
        "name": "Cultivation of Spirit",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Yunara gains Attack Speed, bonus damage On-Hit, and her Attacks spread to nearby enemies.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive</span>: Yunara deal <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(5/10/15/20/25 + (20% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> <span>On-Hit</span> and attacking grants <span>1 Unleash</span> (<span>2 Unleash</span> for champions).<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Active</span>: Yunara consumes <span>8 Unleash</span> and for 5 seconds gains <span>20/30/40/50/60% Attack Speed</span> and deals an additional <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(5/10/15/20/25 + (20% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> <span>On-Hit</span>. During this time, her Attacks spread to nearby enemies dealing them <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(30% Attack Damage) physical damage</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Transcendent State</span>: This Ability is instantly activated for 15 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Spread Attacks can Strike Critically and apply <span>On-Hit</span> effects at 30% effectiveness. Damage from spread Attacks deal 250% damage to minions below <span>30% Health</span>.</span>",
