      "W": {
        "slot": "W",
        "id": "YunaraW",
        "name": "Arc of Judgment | Arc of Ruin",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Yunara fires a spinning prayer bead that deals damage and slows enemies. While in her Transcendent State she instead fires off a laser that deals damage and slows enemies.",
        "bodyHtml": "Yunara lets rip a prayer bead that deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(55/95/135/175/215 + (85% bonus Attack Damage) + (50% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slows by 99% decaying over 1.5 seconds</span>. It deals an additional <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(33/57/81/105/129 + (51% bonus Attack Damage) + (30% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> per second.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Transcendent State - Arc of Ruin</span>: Yunara fires a laser that deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(160/320/480/640/800 + (120% bonus Attack Damage) + (75% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slows by 99% decaying over 1 second</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Cast time scales with permanent <span>Attack Speed</span> (?% / 100%). Arc of Judgment deals 100% damage to minions and its tick damage executes low health minions. Arc of Ruin gains the benefits of an Ultimate Ability.</span>",
